{"content":[{"c":["TIMNAH (P",{"c":["lace"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. One of the cities on the northern boundary of Judah’s inheritance, located between Beth-shemesh and Ekron (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.10","r":"Josh.15.10","rawR":"Josh.15.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.10","value":"Josh.15.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:10"},"). This is the likely site of Judah’s affair with Tamar, which resulted in the birth of Perez and Zerah (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.38.12-14","r":"Gen.38.12-14","rawR":"Gen.38.12-14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.38.12-14","value":"Gen.38.12-14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 38:12-14"},"). A frontier town between Judah and Philistia, Timnah was the place where Samson had his first marital difficulties with one of the daughters of the Philistines (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.14.1-5","r":"Judg.14.1-5","rawR":"Judg.14.1-5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.14.1-5","value":"Judg.14.1-5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 14:1-5"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.15.6","r":"Judg.15.6","rawR":"Judg.15.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.15.6","value":"Judg.15.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"15:6"},"). The town evidently changed hands frequently between the Israelites and the Philistines. Apparently, Israel did achieve control of Timnah during the conquest (cf. ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.19.43","r":"Josh.19.43","rawR":"Josh.19.43","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.19.43","value":"Josh.19.43"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 19:43"},"), but it was under Philistine control by the time of Samson (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.14.1","r":"Judg.14.1","rawR":"Judg.14.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.14.1","value":"Judg.14.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 14:1"},"). Ahaz recaptured Timnah (c. 730 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"},") from the Philistines (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.28.18","r":"2Chr.28.18","rawR":"2Chr.28.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.28.18","value":"2Chr.28.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 28:18"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. One of the cities of the southern hill country that was part of the inheritance of Judah (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.57","r":"Josh.15.57","rawR":"Josh.15.57","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.57","value":"Josh.15.57"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:57"},"). It is possible that this is the site of Judah’s encounter with Tamar (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.38.12-14","r":"Gen.38.12-14","rawR":"Gen.38.12-14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.38.12-14","value":"Gen.38.12-14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 38:12-14"},"; and perhaps the same as #1 above)."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"TimnahPlace","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 15:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.10","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.10","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.10"},{"anchorText":"Gn 38:12-14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.38.12-14","rawQueryValue":"Gen.38.12-14","sourceRefExact":"Gen.38.12-14"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 14:1-5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.14.1-5","rawQueryValue":"Judg.14.1-5","sourceRefExact":"Judg.14.1-5"},{"anchorText":"15:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.15.6","rawQueryValue":"Judg.15.6","sourceRefExact":"Judg.15.6"},{"anchorText":"Jos 19:43","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.19.43","rawQueryValue":"Josh.19.43","sourceRefExact":"Josh.19.43"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 14:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.14.1","rawQueryValue":"Judg.14.1","sourceRefExact":"Judg.14.1"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 28:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.28.18","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.28.18","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.28.18"},{"anchorText":"Jos 15:57","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.57","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.57","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.57"},{"anchorText":"Gn 38:12-14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.38.12-14","rawQueryValue":"Gen.38.12-14","sourceRefExact":"Gen.38.12-14"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"02d4059b9500473cb7b37d9f2031c7e31de2884699b9f65cfe230bdead97f34c","sourceItemName":"TimnahPlace","sourceItemOrder":161,"sourceMember":"Articles/T.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[{"name":"SolomonSPillars","src":"../Pictures/Pictures.xml"}]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"TimnahPlace","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Timnah (Place)","title":"Timnah (Place)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}